==Battleground==
*1 [[Shakurel Doge]] spawns after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>.
*3 [[Shakurel Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*5 [[Shakurel Doge]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*3 [[Shakurel Gory|Shakurel Gories]] (100%) spawn after 56.67 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Shakurel Doge]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Shakurel Gory]] (150%) spawns.
**1 [[Shakurel Lion (Enemy)|Shakurel Lion]] spawns as the boss.


==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

